        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Wooden hilt is wrapped with silk corded braid, diagonally bound with diamond-shaped openings, revealing the rayfish skin underneath.  A large <i>menuki</i> of a buddha is held under the cord.  Iron guard with basket ground and small sprays in gold wire nunome.  Silver fuchi-kashira (waves and clouds), the k. with \"mountain path\".  Silver kojiri (dragon), iroye menuki (the Demon Spider)."@en ;
